{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T17:05:18.529Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/monitor **Type:** Command":"## interface/ethernet/monitor \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/poe **Syscap:**(poe or poe-in) **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/poe \n**Syscap:** （poe 或 poe-in）\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/poe/monitor **Syscap:**(poe or poe-in) **Type:** Command":"## interface/ethernet/poe/monitor \n**Syscap：**（poe 或 poe-in）\n**类型：**命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/poe/power-cycle **Syscap:**(poe or poe-in) **Type:** Command":"## interface/ethernet/poe/power-cycle \n**Syscap：**（poe 或 poe-in）\n**Type：** Command","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/poe/settings **Syscap:**(poe or poe-in) and poesettings **Type:** Settings Directory":"## interface/ethernet/poe/settings \n**Syscap：**（poe 或 poe-in）和 poesettings\n**Type：** Settings Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/pon **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/pon \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## interface/ethernet/reset-counters \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/reset-mac-address **Type:** Command":"## interface/ethernet/reset-mac-address \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/acl **Syscap:** musicswitch **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/acl \n**Syscap：** musicswitch\n**类型：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/acl/policer **Syscap:** musicswitch **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/acl/policer \n**Syscap：** musicswitch\n**类型：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ethernet/switch/dscp-qos-map **Syscap:** musicswitch **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ethernet/switch/dscp-qos-map \n**Syscap：** musicswitch\n**类型：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000Access Control List consists of ingress policy and egress policy engines and allows configuration of up to 128 policy rules(limited by RouterOS). It is an advanced tool for wire-speed packet filtering, forwarding, shaping, and modifying based on Layer2, Layer3, and Layer4 protocol header field conditions.":"访问控制列表由入向策略和出向策略引擎组成，最多可配置 128 条策略规则（受 RouterOS 限制）。它是一种高级工具，可基于 Layer2、Layer3 和 Layer4 协议头字段条件，以线速对数据包进行过滤、转发、整形和修改。","docs-7.25\u0000The global DSCP to QOS mapping table is used for mapping from the DSCP of the packet to new QoS attributes configured in the table.":"全局 DSCP 到 QOS 映射表用于将数据包的 DSCP 映射到表中配置的新 QoS 属性。"}}
